---
description: Validate the selected presentation's update and rollback evidence.
args:
  input: TendrilEvidence
returns: DeviceTerminalReview
---
Use update detail. A different slot is blocked / update-target-mismatch citing target and update receipt. For matching slot, pending-device is waiting / update-pending-device. Failed with activeBuild equal to a non-null previousBuild is attention / rollback-observed, otherwise attention / rollback-unobserved. A proven update is ready / requested-build-active only when activeBuild equals requestedBuild, otherwise attention / build-readback-mismatch. Cite update receipt ID for each result after attribution.
